  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Sunil Chawla vs State Of U.P. And Another on 10 September, 2024 Author: Manoj Kumar Gupta Bench: Manoj Kumar Gupta High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ?Neutral Citation No. - 2024:Ahc:147689-Db Court No. - 21 Case :- Writ - C No. - 30221 of 2024 Petitioner :- Sunil Chawla Respondent :- State of U.P. and Another Counsel for Petitioner :- Amod Pandey,Satyendra Kumar Mishra Counsel for Respondent :- C.S.C. Hon'ble Manoj Kumar Gupta,J. Hon'ble Manish Kumar Nigam,J. 1. The petitioner is aggrieved by order dated 28.10.2023 passed by the Adjudicating Officer under Section 51 of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 and the consequential recovery proceedings by way of recovery certificate dated 10.04.2024. 2.",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioner, after making brief submissions, fairly concedes that the petitioner has alternative remedy of filing appeal before the Appellate Tribunal as per the procedure prescribed under Rule 3.3.1 of the Food Safety and Standards Rules, 2011."
  },
